RECOMMENDATION 1: Scale Peak-Season Infrastructure & Regional Fulfillment Ahead of Q4 Demand
What should be done? Prepare inventory stock levels 30 days prior to peak month of sales which are july,jaunuary and december and establish localized delivery hubs in top-performing sales regions.
Which insight supports the recommendation? Insight 1 (Seasonal Sales Spikes) and Insight 4 (Regional Sales Concentration).
Who would need to act? Operations Team, Supply Chain Managers, and Logistics Partners.
What potential business outcome could it create? Prevents stockouts, reduces website server crashes during peak traffic, and lowers shipping delivery times in high-density customer zones.
What would you measure to determine whether the recommendation worked? Order Fulfillment Rate, Out-of-Stock Rate during Nov–Dec, and Average Delivery Time (Days).


RECOMMENDATION 2: Shift social media campaign to High-Value Core Demographics
What should be done? Reallocate performance marketing spend toward targeted Digital Advertising Budget focusing on the 55+ age cohort.
Which insight supports the recommendation? Insight 2 (Key Target Demographic - 55+ Age Group).
Who would need to act? Marketing Lead and Digital Advertising Team.
What potential business outcome could it create? Increases marketing return on investment  and lowers Customer Acquisition Cost  by targeting the demographic with the highest proven purchasing power.
What would you measure to determine whether the recommendation worked? Return on Ad Spend (ROAS), Conversion Rate for 25–34 age segment, and Average Order Value .


RECOMMENDATION 3: Incentivize Digital Payment Adoption at Checkout
What should be done? Introduce checkout incentives (such as instant payment discounts or bonus loyalty points) for choosing Credit Card and digital payment options over Cash on Delivery (COD).
Which insight supports the recommendation? Insight 5 (Payment Method Spending Differences).
Who would need to act? Product Management Team, Finance Department, and Checkout UX Designers.
What potential business outcome could it create? Increases overall platform Average Order Value (AOV) while reducing cash-handling risks and delivery refusal rates common with COD.
What would you measure to determine whether the recommendation worked? Percentage of Total Transactions via Credit/Digital Payments, Overall Platform AOV, and Order Cancellation Rate.
